          "published": "Wed, 16 Sep 2026 09:29:52 +0800",
          "summary": "<p>财新网09月16日电: 沪指开盘报3861.75点，跌幅0.07%。</p><p>深成指报13276.85点，跌幅0.08%；创业板指报3246.89点，跌幅0.03%；中小板指报8214.29点，跌幅0.09%。</p><p>盘面上，石油石化领涨，交通运输、电子、医药生物、通信、钢铁等板块涨幅居前，农林牧渔领跌，传媒、社会服务、商贸零售、计算机、综合等走弱。</p><p>消息面上，郑栅洁主持召开民营企业座谈会，5家企业负责人参加；“平台月付将退出支付选项”冲上热搜，支付宝、美团等回应；8月社零同比增速放缓至0.4%，走势与市场预期相悖；一线城市二手房价连续六月环比上涨，70城中62城仍环比下跌；小红书发布处置15.7万余个非法荐股等金融违规账号；两部门对在线酒店预订平台服务行业开展行政指导。</p><p>撰写：财小智   责编：财小新</p><div class=\"yqzszb\" id=\"yqzszb\"><div class=\"header\"><div class=\"yqzszb-title\"><strong><span>上市公司敏感舆情指数</span></strong><img alt=\"数据+\" class=\"support\" src=\"https://entities.caixin.com/support.png\" /></div><p><em class=\"update-time\">更新时间：2026-09-16</em></p></div><div class=\"yqzszb-list\"><div class=\"list-header\"><div class=\"order\">排名</div><div class=\"others\"><div class=\"stock\">股票</div><div class=\"index\">今日指数</div><div class=\"comp\">较昨日</div></div></div><ul class=\"yqzszb-lists\"><li><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101014624\"><div class=\"row-order\">1</div></a><div class=\"row-content\"><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101014624\"><div class=\"row-table\"><div class=\"row-info\"><div class=\"name cell\">*ST集友<p><span class=\"stock-no\">603429.SH</span></p></div><div class=\"price cell\">9.87</div><div class=\"rate cell\"><span class=\"price-up\">+9.87</span></div></div></div><div class=\"yqzszb-info\">集友股份关于本次重组相关主体买卖股票情况的自查报告的公告</div></a></div></li><li><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101018262\"><div class=\"row-order\">2</div></a><div class=\"row-content\"><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101018262\"><div class=\"row-table\"><div class=\"row-info\"><div class=\"name cell\">凯赛生物<p><span class=\"stock-no\">688065.SH</span></p></div><div class=\"price cell\">6.24</div><div class=\"rate cell\"><span class=\"price-up\">+6.24</span></div></div></div><div class=\"yqzszb-info\">产能利用率不足10%仍推百亿扩产计划凯赛生物押注新赛道遇现实大考</div></a></div></li><li><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101020418\"><div class=\"row-order\">3</div></a><div class=\"row-content\"><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101020418\"><div class=\"row-table\"><div class=\"row-info\"><div class=\"name cell\">天承科技<p><span class=\"stock-no\">688603.SH</span></p></div><div class=\"price cell\">5.82</div><div class=\"rate cell\"><span class=\"price-up\">+5.82</span></div></div></div><div class=\"yqzszb-info\">天承科技拟H股再上市海外收入占比不足一成</div></a></div></li><li><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101003332\"><div class=\"row-order\">4</div></a><div class=\"row-content\"><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101003332\"><div class=\"row-table\"><div class=\"row-info\"><div class=\"name cell\">广汽集团<p><span class=\"stock-no\">601238.SH</span></p></div><div class=\"price cell\">4.72</div><div class=\"rate cell\"><span class=\"price-down\">-9.51</span></div></div></div><div class=\"yqzszb-info\">广汽集团筹划重组一汽股份将成二股东丰田中国销量降17%或迎南北整合</div></a></div></li><li><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101013092\"><div class=\"row-order\">5</div></a><div class=\"row-content\"><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101013092\"><div class=\"row-table\"><div class=\"row-info\"><div class=\"name cell\">顾家家居<p><span class=\"stock-no\">603816.SH</span></p></div><div class=\"price cell\">4.09</div><div class=\"rate cell\"><span class=\"price-down\">0.00</span></div></div></div><div class=\"yqzszb-info\">柳某诉顾家家居等买卖合同纠纷案2026年11月2日在沈阳市浑南区人民法院开庭</div></a></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"yqzszb-infomation\"><ul><li>今日敏感舆情指数，面向所有A股上市公司，以其前一日9:00至当日9:00的敏感新闻和公告信息为基础，建立模型计算出的0-100的指数，用来表征该上市公司舆情敏感程度的高低。</li><li>本文列举了今日指数最高的5只股票，同时列举了今日指数较昨日的涨跌值，以及时间段内主要的敏感新闻之一。</li><li>获取更多上市公司信息和其他高级服务，请查阅<span><a href=\"http://database.caixin.com\">财新数据通</a></span>。</li><li>本报告基于大数据技术自动计算和生成，不代表财新数据观点。</li></ul></div></div>",
